        {
            "Id": 142401011,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142401,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 11,
            "SpeakerName": "时雨",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "……所以说，别管我啦。/n大黑前辈根本没必要再继续在意这些吧～。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424010100",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "205"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142401012,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142401,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 12,
            "SpeakerName": "大黑",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "我们一直都一起在Eden待到现在，我当然会在意啊！/n而且什么都直来直去地说，不就是你的特点吗！？",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424010110",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "202"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142401013,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142401,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 13,
            "SpeakerName": "时雨",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "什么啊那是……！！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424010120",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "205"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142401014,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142401,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 14,
            "SpeakerName": "仁花子",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "大黑亲是因为担心时雨亲……。/n所以才会像这样问你啊。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424010130",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "203"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142401015,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142401,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 15,
            "SpeakerName": "仁花子",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "你也是，大黑亲！/n不把自己的心情说得再明白一点，是传达不到的！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424010140",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "203"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142401016,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142401,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 16,
            "SpeakerName": "大黑",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "唔……对不起啦……。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424010150",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "202"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142401017,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142401,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 17,
            "SpeakerName": "容",
            "FontSize": 2,
